                    class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-obsidian-elevated hover:bg-white/10 text-[10px] font-bold text-muted-silver hover:text-white border border-obsidian-border transition-all cursor-pointer">
                    ⚡ Replay Jacket Opening
